{"id":438,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"姉妹校ネットワークが広がる清泉女学院","feature_description":"清泉女学院は、人間の尊厳を大切にし、世界およそ20か国50校ほどの姉妹校と理念を共有する学校です。クラブ・委員会・有志の活動が幅広く、生徒が自分の関心に合わせて参加できる環境が整っています。学校生活全体で、愛と責任を学べる点が大きな特色です。平和の種を蒔く人を育てるという理念が一貫しており、委員会や有志活動も含めて参加の場が広いです。","clubs":[{"id":8560,"name":"器械体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seisen-h.ed.jp/life/activity/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8561,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seisen-h.ed.jp/life/activity/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8562,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seisen-h.ed.jp/life/activity/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8563,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seisen-h.ed.jp/life/activity/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8564,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seisen-h.ed.jp/life/activity/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8565,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seisen-h.ed.jp/life/activity/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8566,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seisen-h.ed.jp/life/activity/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8567,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seisen-h.ed.jp/life/activity/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8568,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seisen-h.ed.jp/life/activity/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8569,"name":"E.S.S.（英語部）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seisen-h.ed.jp/life/activity/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8570,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seisen-h.ed.jp/life/activity/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8571,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seisen-h.ed.jp/life/activity/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8572,"name":"化学部